What are Smart Pill Boxes and Bottles?
Smart Pill Boxes and Bottles are medication management devices engineered to improve therapeutic adherence. They combine automated visual, auditory, and tactile reminders with secure compartments or bottles that track each dose. Integrated connectivity-typically Bluetooth, Wi Fi, or cellular based modules-syncs real time dosing data to mobile applications, cloud dashboards, and electronic health records (EHRs). The technology is especially valuable for patients with chronic conditions, cognitive impairments, or complex poly pharmacy regimens, where even a single missed dose can jeopardize clinical outcomes.
